// Public Spectra surface for the HTTP/3 transport.
//
// Handles use the ABI's integer representation. Server configuration and
// handlers remain Rust-owned; this binding intentionally exposes no string
// constructors for TLS material or callbacks. Native function declarations
// are supplied by the compiler's std.api.http3 module and target the
// spectra.api.http3 host namespace.

module std.api.http3
